msgstr "Hur konferensläget väljer bästa svar (change ai-orchestration-tidy-up 7.3). Kan överridas per anrop via context-nyckeln conference_mechanism."

#. module: ai_agent_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_agent_core.field_ai_okf_concept__embedding_state
msgid ""
"How creating the concept vector went. pending = no provider/key at the time;"
" cron fills in. failed = the provider answered but the vector was wrong "
"(wrong dimension) — needs action. skipped = no text to vectorise. Needed so "
"backfill knows what is missing — without the marker an empty column looks "
"the same whatever the reason."
msgstr "Hur det gick att skapa konceptets vektor. pending = ingen provider/nyckel vid tillfället; cron fyller på. failed = leverantören svarade men vektorn var felaktig (fel dimension) — kräver åtgärd. skipped = ingen text att vektorisera. Behövs för att efterfyllnad ska veta vad som saknas — utan markering ser en tom kolumn likadan ut oavsett orsak."

